title: "Rendanheyi is a Hoare Program (a Rendanheyi Hoare Script, with a Huidu Hull)"
description: "The Chairperson's 2026-07-16 recognition: every script under every skill is a micro-enterprise whose contract is a Hoare triple, protocol files are the shared assertions that compose them without an orchestrator, and the Huidu hull is the bounded grey boundary where model inference compresses open-world input into crisp preconditions — with obsmetrologia bridges (ledgers, entropy, predication, claims)."
