cites:
  - "A Century of Gestalt Psychology in Visual Perception: I. Perceptual Grouping and Figure-Ground Organization"�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;IYarvD2FHPUcyJEzMyj60iCpHAdQgxugDBgW-T3_imQ�dpair�dleft�dstar�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�dunit�dmark`�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;ToMzLDKFlOjMS94c281OzcyjH4VfT8y2E6eJBhk8UG8�dpair�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�dleft�dstar�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�dunit�dmarkb37�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;XM8nTtxiIn0qec1etXeStq7u1nBTrqnMojocpgqeMCQ�dpair�eright�dunit�dleft�dstar�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�dunit�dmark`�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;HVLB-W1_TEukdSifAikCjyv3oqEI__a5nDFCTh0vRFY�dpair�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�dleft�dstar�dunit�dmarkrVisual Engineering�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;SDr1XAcQtGsgAG7JCtQzLa7QV_upH085yM1oVHHuaZ4�dpair�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�dleft�dstar�dunit�dmarky
## Abstract

This paper defines "Visual Engineering Practices" as a composite discipline assembled from four lineages — [Bauhaus pedagogy](../../../schools/bauhaus-pedagogy.md), [Brutalism](../../../schools/brutalism.md) (as ethic and constraint-set), [Cubism](../../../schools/cubism.md) (as anti-closure tactics), and [Edward Tufte's information design](../../../schools/tuftean-information-design.md) (as integrity under constraint). The project is not to produce an eclectic style, but to enumerate portable constraints in their native terms and show how, in combination, they yield specific outcomes: [glance-direction](../terms/glance-direction.md) (rapid orienting), [non-linear reading](../terms/non-linear-reading.md) (designed routing rather than smooth consumption), [felt weight](../terms/felt-weight.md) (perceptual mass and structural emphasis), [peripheral uptake](../terms/peripheral-uptake.md) (pre-attentive and field-based [legibility](../../../../sociology/terms/legibility.md)), and [memetic repeatability](../terms/memetic-repeatability.md) (a learnable kit that travels). The paper proceeds in two passes: (1) a lineage catalog that states each inherited "move" and why it matters for the target outcomes; and (2) a synthesis that treats the composite as a system whose shared target is [orientation before interpretation](../concepts/orientation-before-interpretation.md) and whose shared enemy is [premature closure](../concepts/premature-closure.md). The final sections translate the constraints into repeatable layout "recipes," provide worked readings of three representative artifacts (as analytic templates), and name refusals necessary to keep the composite coherent.

