"Visual Engineering Practices" names a working kit: a deliberately assembled composite discipline rather than a single tradition or a personal "style." The engineering claim is modest and specific. It does not mean formal proof, nor does it borrow engineering authority as a rhetorical costume. It means that the practice is constraint-led: it selects, formalizes, and repeatedly applies constraints that reliably generate certain perceptual behaviors in readers.

The paper's job is to (a) enumerate constraints as each tradition understood them (or, where necessary, as faithfully as possible given translation across media), and (b) explain why the composite produces the outcomes repeatedly observed in the artifacts: gaze routing, non-linear reading, felt weight, peripheral uptake, and memetic repeatability.�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;eX9gJgWqw85khs6WnF2DtkypkUcaZywe1dOLdJtVq3I�dpair�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�dleft�dstar�dunit�dmarkgcurrent�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;P1Up_7RLGxUakCz5-Z2s8a3IpRLpidsmpwx6ZC-II1Q�dpair�dleft�dstar�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�dunit�dmark`�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;CydZ2icpHanh1mIgqZiv2RLGJWSKMQJqLhgA_ithwIg�dpair�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�dleft�dstar�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�dunit�dmarkc444�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;nRrwXITb540_9pZWTp3eVjMKy9grLyAANdyIrB_P7TA�dpair�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�dleft�dstar�dunit�dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;X4h0AziAPXCspXiLGkXFxYPxOvu9Qy4rSynKw3M3CyY�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;1XhLCFEQyDXC3ja2BtcrhQR-rQ6cnRfHTadJNS4wJTo�dpair�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�dleft�dstar�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�dunit�dmarkefalse�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;J8o5fmaTN_by8mBv88klULjBB2qLDxrSekOx9i0cgjs�dpair�eright�dunit�dleft�dstar�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�dunit�dmark`�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;JBVuv6iH3Ftw7OCBqEUwmTpqoiBujNlP5zOaxrROJto�dpair�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�dleft�dstar�dunit�dmarkpmarket.561.group�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;5rtqrTRwq-e4ItL3m6Mt0jtEqkssxKlundSu316UhFA�dpair�dleft�dstar�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�dunit�dmark`�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx