Memetic repeatability is one of five operational outcomes defined by [visual engineering practices](../index.md). It names the practice's capacity for transmission: the kit propagates because it can be taught as constraints and checks, not as ineffable taste. It travels through re-performance, not merely through slogans.

Memetic repeatability arises because the composite is teachable as constraints: a limited device-set, explicit hierarchy rules, repeatable fragmentation tactics, and integrity checks. Each of these can be named, demonstrated, and re-applied by other makers without requiring access to the original practitioner's sensibility.�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;GqtQFe8YPRuTdRqZYvGd6tnHuuM3zI1Mo6LJ4QyyuDU�dpair�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�dleft�dstar�dunit�dmarkgcurrent�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;akQDUysWXSu1MvTzrHycVsh2JKXUTBRVxY4MZ-bxo-Q�dpair�dleft�dstar�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�dunit�dmark`�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;fdfsR-K-S9kazFWpbrhLyuphserMEFoHB-vnedPdru0�dpair�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�dleft�dstar�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�dunit�dmarkd1691�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;r1WguEuoBSbt4UNiP5CtibzvfiO6o4K9xuSUaTKPtiE�dpair�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�dleft�dstar�dunit�dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;bBFsy4t00UQgiPq99KPPa51Mj4ISslz4SK8clcBNvdw�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;SFRXjvqF0nq5hJQ3zXE8pH9xXIcfRflPloOC23-M6kc�dpair�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�dleft�dstar�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�dunit�dmarkefalse�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;EdXFHnT6zhpwWLhZ5iTjHuBvoQJkL1BRKXKvwAAJrvo�dpair�eright�dunit�dleft�dstar�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�dunit�dmark`�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;jI8pLl1ilt3C6hvN4D_zatdo24A-zDFsSZ43sCs6NM0�dpair�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�dleft�dstar�dunit�dmarkrVisual Engineering�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;qMQSmgXCEnDCvsVuPkuYBpWjQDAaK3wZjHEOsv6eNwo�dpair�dleft�dstar�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�dunit�dmark`�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;nN3fhx