Non-linear reading is one of five operational outcomes defined by [visual engineering practices](../index.md). It names the artifact's capacity to support scanning, jumping, and revisiting without collapse into a single linear sentence-by-sentence path. It treats reading as navigation across anchors, not as pure flow.

Non-linear reading arises when [cubist](../../../schools/cubism.md) discontinuity and multi-frame layout interrupt smooth flow, while [Bauhaus](../../../schools/bauhaus-pedagogy.md) rhythm provides recurring footholds and [Tuftean](../../../schools/tuftean-information-design.md) micro/macro coherence ensures that jumps remain meaningful rather than arbitrary.�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;9ZzqNVJ6zAJZWyVli_Dfvmw7CV7lJyEJYiUodYJ7ZwE�dpair�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�dleft�dstar�dunit�dmarkgcurrent�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;lxi31jCoXw8Bruokn0hWCRshlCasyvA2wCRMb9V5nfE�dpair�dleft�dstar�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�dunit�dmark`�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;FwjVJPVbDjuc1Vo4eL3EO_zruWstnBQ8uz-dAyWUKEU�dpair�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�dleft�dstar�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�dunit�dmarkd2357�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;JKefqchafY7FycMA4Ue-DISDqSDXtk0AqR-VILkakFQ�dpair�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�dleft�dstar�dunit�dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;3BQ79lANDTkzOQeAoN-GWMr22p_b4AQt3RrnWhee6-E�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;CGFOyE8K9N6zV1s-pZEo0NoYHgAGp8VEprid67_hFK0�dpair�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�dleft�dstar�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�dunit�dmarkefalse�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;EQ-zAJTI0BqDLL7IVk9XdTQNyfB0CqYMgEPabg5B5co�dpair�eright�dunit�dleft�dstar�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�dunit�dmark`�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;DgwjaA04kUe4RyECosaYBEY3BK0MdQK5ItZ_yCEjzmc�dpair�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�eright�dunit�dleft�dstar�dunit�dmarkrVisual Engineering�dpair�hconstant�dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;_4gfGaVPrfRydy3gY2BKUKZYynkIbw_XN2sNmqsrkxc�dpair�dleft�dstar�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�csum�dunit�dunit�dmark`�dpair�hconstan